e=\"green_chromis_std\" data-length=\"3\" data-min-gallons=\"30\">\n                  Green Chromis – ~3\" (30 gal min., souvent en groupe)\n                <\/option>\n              <\/select>\n\n              <label>Quantité :<\/label>\n              <input type=\"number\"\n                     class=\"fish-qty-input\"\n                     data-family=\"chromis\"\n                     min=\"0\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/details>\n\n      <!-- 🟢 Gobies (génériques) -->\n      <details class=\"fish-group\" data-family=\"goby\">\n        <summary>\n          <span class=\"label\">Gobies<\/span>\n          <span class=\"chevron\">▶<\/span>\n        <\/summary>\n        <div class=\"fish-group-body\">\n          <label>Variante :<\/label>\n          <select class=\"fish-variant-select\"\n                  data-family=\"goby\">\n            <option value=\"goby_clown\" data-length=\"2\" data-min-gallons=\"15\">\n              Petit \/ clown goby – ~2\" (15 gal min.)\n            <\/option>\n            <option value=\"goby_watchman\" data-length=\"3\" data-min-gallons=\"30\">\n              Watchman \/ shrimp goby – ~3\" (30 gal min.)\n            <\/option>\n            <option value=\"goby_sand\" data-length=\"3\" data-min-gallons=\"30\">\n              Sand sifting goby – ~3\" (30 gal min.)\n            <\/option>\n          <\/select>\n\n          <label>Quantité :<\/label>\n          <input type=\"number\"\n                 class=\"fish-qty-input\"\n                 data-family=\"goby\"\n                 min=\"0\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n\n          <p>Choisissez la catégorie la plus proche du goby que vous souhaitez ajouter.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/details>\n\n      <!-- 🌿 Lawnmower Blenny (AquaCorail) -->\n      <details class=\"fish-group\" data-family=\"blenny\">\n        <summary>\n          <span class=\"label\">Blenny (Lawnmower)<\/span>\n          <span class=\"chevron\">▶<\/span>\n        <\/summary>\n        <div class=\"fish-group-body\">\n          <div class=\"fish-group-row\">\n            <div class=\"fish-group-side\">\n              <a href=\"https:\/\/aquacorail.ca\/products\/lawnmower-blenny?_pos=1&_psq=lawn&_ss=e&_v=1.0\"\n                 target=\"_blank\">\n                <img\n                  src=\"{{ all_products['lawnmower-blenny'].featured_image | image_url: width: 300 }}\"\n                  alt=\"Lawnmower Blenny\">\n              <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"fish-group-main\">\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 4px;font-size:12px;\">\n                À partir de\n                <strong>{{ all_products['lawnmower-blenny'].price | money }}<\/strong> –\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/aquacorail.ca\/products\/lawnmower-blenny?_pos=1&_psq=lawn&_ss=e&_v=1.0\"\n                   target=\"_blank\">\n                  voir la fiche produit\n                <\/a>\n              <\/p>\n\n              <label>Variante :<\/label>\n              <select class=\"fish-variant-select\"\n                      data-family=\"blenny\">\n                <option value=\"lawnmower_blenny_std\" data-length=\"3\" data-min-gallons=\"20\">\n                  Lawnmower Blenny – ~3\" (20 gal min.)\n                <\/option>\n              <\/select>\n\n              <label>Quantité :<\/label>\n              <input type=\"number\"\n                     class=\"fish-qty-input\"\n                     data-family=\"blenny\"\n                     min=\"0\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n\n              <p>\n                Blenny surtout herbivore, très utile contre les algues. Bac bien établi recommandé.\n              <\/p>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/details>\n\n      <!-- 🌈 Wrasses (génériques) -->\n      <details class=\"fish-group\" data-family=\"wrasse\">\n        <summary>\n          <span class=\"label\">Wrasses (féeriques \/ flasher \/ divers)<\/span>\n          <span class=\"chevron\">▶<\/span>\n        <\/summary>\n        <div class=\"fish-group-body\">\n          <label>Variante :<\/label>\n          <select class=\"fish-variant-select\"\n                  data-family=\"wrasse\">\n            <option value=\"wrasse_fairy\" data-length=\"4\" data-min-gallons=\"50\">\n              Fairy \/ flasher wrasse – ~4\" (50 gal min.)\n            <\/option>\n            <option value=\"wrasse_other\" data-length=\"5\" data-min-gallons=\"75\">\n              Autres wrasses – ~5\" (75 gal min.)\n            <\/option>\n          <\/select>\n\n          <label>Quantité :<\/label>\n          <input type=\"number\"\n                 class=\"fish-qty-input\"\n                 data-family=\"wrasse\"\n                 min=\"0\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <\/div>\n      <\/details>\n\n      <!-- 🐟 Tangs (génériques) -->\n      <details class=\"fish-group\" data-family=\"tang\">\n        <summary>\n          <span class=\"label\">Tangs \/ Chirurgiens<\/span>\n          <span class=\"chevron\">▶<\/span>\n        <\/summary>\n        <div class=\"fish-group-body\">\n          <label>Variante :<\/label>\n          <select class=\"fish-variant-select\"\n                  data-family=\"tang\">\n            <option value=\"tang_med\" data-length=\"8\" data-min-gallons=\"75\">\n              Tang moyen (ex. Yellow, Kole) – ~8\" (75 gal min.)\n            <\/option>\n            <option value=\"tang_large\" data-length=\"10\" data-min-gallons=\"120\">\n              Grand tang (ex. Naso) – ~10\" (120 gal min.)\n            <\/option>\n          <\/select>\n\n          <label>Quantité :<\/label>\n          <input type=\"number\"\n                 class=\"fish-qty-input\"\n                 data-family=\"tang\"\n                 min=\"0\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <\/div>\n      <\/details>\n\n      <!-- Tu peux garder \/ enlever les familles génériques suivantes selon ton besoin -->\n\n      <details class=\"fish-group\" data-family=\"damsel\">\n        <summary>\n          <span class=\"label\">Damselfish<\/span>\n          <span class=\"chevron\">▶<\/span>\n        <\/summary>\n        <div class=\"fish-group-body\">\n          <label>Variante :<\/label>\n          <select class=\"fish-variant-select\"\n                  data-family=\"damsel\">\n            <option value=\"damsel_std\" data-length=\"3\" data-min-gallons=\"30\">\n              Damselfish – ~3\" (30 gal min.)\n            <\/option>\n          <\/select>\n\n          <label>Quantité :<\/label>\n          <input type=\"number\"\n                 class=\"fish-qty-input\"\n                 data-family=\"damsel\"\n                 min=\"0\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <\/div>\n      <\/details>\n\n      <details class=\"fish-group\" data-family=\"dottyback\">\n        <summary>\n          <span class=\"label\">Dottybacks \/ Pseudochromis<\/span>\n          <span class=\"chevron\">▶<\/span>\n        <\/summary>\n        <div class=\"fish-group-body\">\n          <label>Variante :<\/label>\n          <select class=\"fish-variant-select\"\n                  data-family=\"dottyback\">\n            <option value=\"dottyback_std\" data-length=\"3\" data-min-gallons=\"30\">\n              Dottyback – ~3\" (30 gal min.)\n            <\/option>\n          <\/select>\n\n          <label>Quantité :<\/label>\n          <input type=\"number\"\n                 class=\"fish-qty-input\"\n                 data-family=\"dottyback\"\n                 min=\"0\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <\/div>\n      <\/details>\n\n      <details class=\"fish-group\" data-family=\"anthias\">\n        <summary>\n          <span class=\"label\">Anthias<\/span>\n          <span class=\"chevron\">▶<\/span>\n        <\/summary>\n        <div class=\"fish-group-body\">\n          <label>Variante :<\/label>\n          <select class=\"fish-variant-select\"\n                  data-family=\"anthias\">\n            <option value=\"anthias_std\" data-length=\"4\" data-min-gallons=\"70\">\n              Anthias – ~4\" (70 gal min., souvent en groupe)\n            <\/option>\n          <\/select>\n\n          <label>Quantité :<\/label>\n          <input type=\"number\"\n                 class=\"fish-qty-input\"\n                 data-family=\"anthias\"\n                 min=\"0\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <\/div>\n      <\/details>\n\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n\n  <!-- Résultats visuels -->\n  <div id=\"fish-results\" style=\"margin-top:25px;border-top:1px solid #ddd;padding-top:20px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:18px;margin-bottom:8px;\">Résumé de la charge biologique<\/h3>\n\n    <div class=\"result-panel\">\n      <div class=\"result-main\">\n        <div class=\"result-metric\">\n          <span class=\"result-label\">Taux d’occupation du bac :<\/span>\n          <span class=\"result-value\" id=\"tankUsage\">-<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n\n        <div class=\"progress-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"progress-bar-bg\">\n            <div class=\"progress-bar-fill\" id=\"tankUsageBar\"><\/div>\n          <\/div>\n          <span class=\"progress-note status-idle\" id=\"tankUsageBadge\">\n            En attente de données.\n          <\/span>\n        <\/div>\n\n        <p id=\"adviceText\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:#555;margin-top:6px;\"><\/p>\n        <p id=\"tankTypeNote\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:#777;margin-top:4px;\">\n          Type de bac sélectionné : Bac récifal (par défaut).\n        <\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n\n    <h4 style=\"font-size:15px;margin:8px 0 6px;\">Poissons sélectionnés<\/h4>\n    <div class=\"result-table-wrapper\">\n      <table class=\"result-table\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>Famille<\/th>\n            <th>Variante<\/th>\n            <th>Qté<\/th>\n            <th>Longueur utilisée (po)<\/th>\n            <th>Total (po)<\/th>\n            <th>Volume min. recommandé<\/th>\n          <\/tr>\n        <\/thead>\n        <tbody id=\"resultTableBody\">\n          <tr class=\"result-table-empty\">\n            <td colspan=\"6\">Aucun poisson sélectionné pour le moment.<\/td>\n          <\/tr>\n        <\/tbody>\n      <\/table>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<script>\n(function() {\n  \/\/ Labels lisibles pour les familles (affichage dans le tableau)\n  var familyLabels = {\n    clownfish: \"Poisson clown\",\n    firefish: \"Firefish \/ Dartfish\",\n    royal_gramma: \"Royal Gramma & basslets\",\n    yellow_clown_goby: \"Yellow Clown Goby\",\n    dwarf_angelfish: \"Dwarf angelfish\",\n    cardinalfish: \"Cardinalfish\",\n    chromis: \"Chromis\",\n    goby: \"Gobies\",\n    blenny: \"Blennies\",\n    wrasse: \"Wrasses\",\n    tang: \"Tangs \/ Chirurgiens\",\n    damsel: \"Damselfish\",\n    dottyback: \"Dottybacks \/ Pseudochromis\",\n    anthias: \"Anthias\"\n  };\n\n  \/\/ Config de base pour le calcul (taille en pouces + gallonage minimum)\n  var fishConfig = {\n    clownfish: {\n      variants: {\n        ocellaris_cb: { lengthInches: 4, minGallons: 20 }\n      }\n    },\n    firefish: {\n      variants: {\n        firefish_std:        { lengthInches: 3.0,  minGallons: 20 },\n        purple_firefish_std: { lengthInches: 3.25, minGallons: 20 }\n      }\n    },\n    royal_gramma: {\n      variants: {\n        royal_gramma_std: { lengthInches: 3, minGallons: 30 }\n      }\n    },\n    yellow_clown_goby: {\n      variants: {\n        yellow_clown_goby_std: { lengthInches: 1.5, minGallons: 20 }\n      }\n    },\n    dwarf_angelfish: {\n      variants: {\n        flame_angelfish_std: { lengthInches: 4, minGallons: 70 },\n        coral_beauty_std:    { lengthInches: 6, minGallons: 70 }\n      }\n    },\n    cardinalfish: {\n      variants: {\n        pajama_cardinalfish_std: { lengthInches: 3, minGallons: 30 }\n      }\n    },\n    chromis: {\n      variants: {\n        green_chromis_std: { lengthInches: 3, minGallons: 30 }\n      }\n    },\n    goby: {\n      variants: {\n        goby_clown:    { lengthInches: 2, minGallons: 15 },\n        goby_watchman: { lengthInches: 3, minGallons: 30 },\n        goby_sand:     { lengthInches: 3, minGallons: 30 }\n      }\n    },\n    blenny: {\n      variants: {\n        lawnmower_blenny_std: { lengthInches: 3, minGallons: 20 }\n      }\n    },\n    wrasse: {\n      variants: {\n        wrasse_fairy: { lengthInches: 4, minGallons: 50 },\n        wrasse_other: { lengthInches: 5, minGallons: 75 }\n      }\n    },\n    tang: {\n      variants: {\n        tang_med:   { lengthInches: 8,  minGallons: 75 },\n        tang_large: { lengthInches: 10, minGallons: 120 }\n      }\n    },\n    damsel: {\n      variants: {\n        damsel_std: { lengthInches: 3, minGallons: 30 }\n      }\n    },\n    dottyback: {\n      variants: {\n        dottyback_std: { lengthInches: 3, minGallons: 30 }\n      }\n    },\n    anthias: {\n      variants: {\n        anthias_std: { lengthInches: 4, minGallons: 70 }\n      }\n    }\n  };\n\n  window.fishCalc = window.fishCalc || {};\n\n  \/\/ Calcule la somme totale en pouces de poissons\n  function calculerTotalPouces() {\n    var total = 0;\n    var qtyInputs = document.querySelectorAll('.fish-qty-input');\n\n    qtyInputs.forEach(function(input) {\n      var qty = parseInt(input.value, 10) || 0;\n      var family = input.getAttribute('data-family');\n      var select = document.querySelector('.fish-variant-select[data-family=\"' + family + '\"]');\n      if (!family || !select || !fishConfig[family]) return;\n\n      var variantKey = select.value;\n      var variantConf = fishConfig[family].variants[variantKey];\n      if (!variantConf) return;\n\n      total += qty * variantConf.lengthInches;\n    });\n\n    window.fishCalc.totalInches = total;\n    return total;\n  }\n\n  \/\/ Met à jour le tableau récapitulatif des poissons sélectionnés\n  function mettreAJourTableauResultats() {\n    var tbody = document.getElementById('resultTableBody');\n    if (!tbody) return;\n\n    tbody.innerHTML = '';\n    var qtyInputs = document.querySelectorAll('.fish-qty-input');\n    var any = false;\n\n    qtyInputs.forEach(function(input) {\n      var qty = parseInt(input.value, 10) || 0;\n      if (!qty || qty <= 0) return;\n\n      var family = input.getAttribute('data-family');\n      var select = document.querySelector('.fish-variant-select[data-family=\"' + family + '\"]');\n      if (!family || !select || !fishConfig[family]) return;\n\n      var variantKey = select.value;\n      var variantConf = fishConfig[family].variants[variantKey];\n      if (!variantConf) return;\n\n      any = true;\n      var lengthInches = variantConf.lengthInches || 0;\n      var minGallons = variantConf.minGallons || 0;\n      var totalInches = qty * lengthInches;\n\n      var tr = document.createElement('tr');\n\n      var tdFamily = document.createElement('td');\n      tdFamily.textContent = familyLabels[family] || family;\n      tr.appendChild(tdFamily);\n\n      var tdVariant = document.createElement('td');\n      tdVariant.textContent = select.options[select.selectedIndex].text;\n      tr.appendChild(tdVariant);\n\n      var tdQty = document.createElement('td');\n      tdQty.textContent = qty;\n      tr.appendChild(tdQty);\n\n      var tdLen = document.createElement('td');\n      tdLen.textContent = lengthInches.toFixed(1);\n      tr.appendChild(tdLen);\n\n      var tdTotal = document.createElement('td');\n      tdTotal.textContent = totalInches.toFixed(1);\n      tr.appendChild(tdTotal);\n\n      var tdGallons = document.createElement('td');\n      tdGallons.textContent = minGallons > 0 ? (minGallons + \" gal min.\") : \"-\";\n      tr.appendChild(tdGallons);\n\n      tbody.appendChild(tr);\n    });\n\n    if (!any) {\n      var trEmpty = document.createElement('tr');\n      trEmpty.className = 'result-table-empty';\n      var tdEmpty = document.createElement('td');\n      tdEmpty.colSpan = 6;\n      tdEmpty.textContent = 'Aucun poisson sélectionné pour le moment.';\n      trEmpty.appendChild(tdEmpty);\n      tbody.appendChild(trEmpty);\n    }\n  }\n\n  function recalculerPopulationPoissons() {\n    var tankInput   = document.getElementById('tankGallons');\n    var rockInput   = document.getElementById('rockLbs');\n    var rockRecP    = document.getElementById('rockRecommendation');\n    var filtSelect  = document.getElementById('filtration');\n    var refugeCb    = document.getElementById('hasRefuge');\n    var usageElem   = document.getElementById('tankUsage');\n    var adviceElem  = document.getElementById('adviceText');\n    var barElem     = document.getElementById('tankUsageBar');\n    var badgeElem   = document.getElementById('tankUsageBadge');\n\n    var gallons = tankInput ? (parseFloat(tankInput.value) || 0) : 0;\n    var rockLbs = rockInput ? (parseFloat(rockInput.value) || 0) : 0;\n\n    \/\/ Texte de roche vivante\n    if (rockRecP) {\n      if (gallons > 0) {\n        var recommended = gallons;\n        var txt = 'Recommandation : environ ' + recommended.toFixed(1) +\n          ' lb de roche vivante pour un bac de ' + gallons.toFixed(1) + ' gallons. ' +\n          'Vous avez indiqué ' + rockLbs.toFixed(1) + ' lb. ' +\n          'Le calcul sécuritaire d’environ 1 po de poisson par gallon (≈ 50 % de la règle des 2 po\/gal) ' +\n          's’applique seulement lorsque vous êtes proche de 1 lb de roche par gallon.';\n        rockRecP.textContent = txt;\n      } else {\n        rockRecP.textContent =\n          'Recommandation générale : 1 lb de roche vivante par gallon. ' +\n          'Le calcul sécuritaire d’environ 1 po de poisson par gallon (≈ 50 % de la règle des 2 po\/gal) ' +\n          'suppose que cette quantité de roches est respectée.';\n      }\n    }\n\n    \/\/ Met à jour le tableau des poissons sélectionnés\n    mettreAJourTableauResultats();\n\n    if (!usageElem || !adviceElem) return;\n\n    if (gallons <= 0) {\n      usageElem.textContent = '-';\n      adviceElem.textContent = 'Entrez le volume de votre aquarium pour démarrer le calcul.';\n      if (barElem) barElem.style.width = '0%';\n      if (badgeElem) {\n        badgeElem.textContent = 'En attente de données.';\n        badgeElem.className = 'progress-note status-idle';\n      }\n      return;\n    }\n\n    \/\/ Capacité brute de base (~1 po\/gal, soit 50 % de la règle 2 po\/gal)\n    var baseCapacityInches = gallons * 1;\n\n    \/\/ Facteur roche vivante\n    var rockFactor = 1;\n    if (gallons > 0) {\n      var ratio = rockLbs \/ gallons;\n      if (ratio >= 1) rockFactor = 1;\n      else if (ratio > 0) rockFactor = ratio;\n      else rockFactor = 0;\n    }\n\n    \/\/ Facteur filtration (nouveaux types)\n    var filtrationValue = filtSelect ? filtSelect.value : 'hob';\n    var filtrationFactor = 1;\n    if (filtrationValue === 'hob')      filtrationFactor = 1.0;\n    if (filtrationValue === 'canister') filtrationFactor = 1.05;\n    if (filtrationValue === 'aio')      filtrationFactor = 1.05;\n    if (filtrationValue === 'sump')     filtrationFactor = 1.10;\n\n    \/\/ Facteur refuge\n    var refugeFactor = (refugeCb && refugeCb.checked) ? 1.05 : 1.0;\n\n    \/\/ Facteur total de système\n    var systemFactor = rockFactor * filtrationFactor * refugeFactor;\n\n    var effectiveCapacityInches = baseCapacityInches * systemFactor;\n    var totalInches = calculerTotalPouces();\n\n    window.fishCalc.baseCapacityInches      = baseCapacityInches;\n    window.fishCalc.effectiveCapacityInches = effectiveCapacityInches;\n    window.fishCalc.rockFactor              = rockFactor;\n    window.fishCalc.filtrationFactor        = filtrationFactor;\n    window.fishCalc.refugeFactor            = refugeFactor;\n\n    if (effectiveCapacityInches <= 0) {\n      usageElem.textContent = totalInches.toFixed(1) + ' po \/ capacité non disponible (pas assez de roche).';\n      adviceElem.textContent =\n        'Vous n’avez pas assez de roche vivante pour appliquer même le calcul sécuritaire (~1 po\/gal). ' +\n        'Augmentez la quantité de roche avant d’ajouter des poissons.';\n      if (barElem) barElem.style.width = '0%';\n      if (badgeElem) {\n        badgeElem.textContent = 'Pas assez de roche vivante.';\n        badgeElem.className = 'progress-note status-alert';\n      }\n      return;\n    }\n\n    var percent = (totalInches \/ effectiveCapacityInches) * 100;\n    if (!isFinite(percent)) percent = 0;\n\n    usageElem.textContent =\n      totalInches.toFixed(1) + ' po \/ ' +\n      effectiveCapacityInches.toFixed(1) + ' po (' +\n      percent.toFixed(0) + '%)';\n\n    \/\/ Barre de progression\n    if (barElem) {\n      var clamped = Math.max(0, Math.min(percent, 130));\n      barElem.style.width = clamped + '%';\n\n      if (percent < 70) {\n        barElem.style.background = '#4caf50';\n      } else if (percent <= 100) {\n        barElem.style.background = '#ff9800';\n      } else {\n        barElem.style.background = '#f44336';\n      }\n    }\n\n    if (badgeElem) {\n      if (totalInches === 0) {\n        badgeElem.textContent = 'Aucun poisson sélectionné.';\n        badgeElem.className = 'progress-note status-idle';\n      } else if (percent < 70) {\n        badgeElem.textContent = 'Zone confortable.';\n        badgeElem.className = 'progress-note status-ok';\n      } else if (percent <= 100) {\n        badgeElem.textContent = 'Vous approchez de la limite recommandée.';\n        badgeElem.className = 'progress-note status-warn';\n      } else {\n        badgeElem.textContent = 'Surpeuplement : à corriger.';\n        badgeElem.className = 'progress-note status-alert';\n      }\n    }\n\n    if (totalInches === 0) {\n      adviceElem.textContent = 'Aucun poisson sélectionné pour le moment. Ajoutez des poissons pour voir l’impact sur la population.';\n    } else if (percent < 70) {\n      adviceElem.textContent = 'Votre population est dans une zone confortable. Vous avez encore une bonne marge tant que la qualité de l’eau reste stable.';\n    } else if (percent <= 100) {\n      adviceElem.textContent = 'Vous approchez de la capacité recommandée. Surveillez vos paramètres et évitez d’ajouter trop d’autres poissons.';\n    } else {\n      adviceElem.textContent = 'Vous dépassez la capacité recommandée pour ce volume et cette configuration. Il est conseillé de réduire la population ou d’améliorer le système (plus de volume, de roches, meilleure filtration).';\n    }\n  }\n\n  function initTankTypeToggle() {\n    var buttons = document.querySelectorAll('.tank-type-button');\n    var noteElem = document.getElementById('tankTypeNote');\n\n    function labelForType(type) {\n      if (type === 'reef')      return 'Bac récifal';\n      if (type === 'fish-only') return 'Fish only (eau salée sans coraux)';\n      if (type === 'fowlr')     return 'FOWLR (fish + roches vivantes)';\n      return type;\n    }\n\n    buttons.forEach(function(btn) {\n      btn.addEventListener('click', function() {\n        buttons.forEach(function(b) { b.classList.remove('is-active'); });\n        btn.classList.add('is-active');\n\n        var t = btn.getAttribute('data-tank-type') || 'reef';\n        window.fishCalc.tankType = t;\n\n        if (noteElem) {\n          noteElem.textContent = 'Type de bac sélectionné : ' + labelForType(t) + '.';\n        }\n\n        recalculerPopulationPoissons();\n      });\n    });\n\n    window.fishCalc.tankType = 'reef';\n  }\n\n  function initEventListeners() {\n    document.addEventListener('input', function(e) {\n      if (\n        e.target.matches('.fish-qty-input') ||\n        e.target.matches('.fish-variant-select') ||\n        e.target.id === 'tankGallons' ||\n        e.target.id === 'rockLbs' ||\n        e.target.id === 'filtration' ||\n        e.target.id === 'hasRefuge'\n      ) {\n        recalculerPopulationPoissons();\n      }\n    });\n  }\n\n  \/\/ Important pour Shopify : on initialise directement\n  initTankTypeToggle();\n  initEventListeners();\n  recalculerPopulationPoissons();\n})();\n<\/script>","spacing_desktop":50,"spacing_mobile":30,"fix_zindex":0}}},"order":["breadcrumbs","main-page","section_custom_liquid_XGnRmR"]}